{
    "chapter_num": 8,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Obey Authorities for God’s Sake"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " like a wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And who knows the interpretation of a thing?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "A man’s wisdom makes his face shine,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. strength"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sternness of his face is changed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Obey Authorities for God’s Sake"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "say,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " “Keep the king’s commandment for the sake of your oath to God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not be hasty to go from his presence. Do not take your stand for an evil thing, for he does whatever pleases him.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Where the word of a king "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is, there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " power;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And who may say to him, “What are you doing?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who keeps his command will experience nothing harmful;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And a wise man’s heart "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. knows"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "discerns both time and judgment,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Because for every matter there is a time and judgment,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Though the misery of man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "is great upon him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "increases greatly."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he does not know what will happen;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So who can tell him when it will occur?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "No one has power over the spirit to retain the spirit,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And no one has power in the day of death."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no release from that war,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And wickedness will not deliver those who are given to it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All this I have seen, and applied my heart to every work that is done under the sun: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "There is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a time in which one man rules over another to his own hurt."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Death Comes to All"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then I saw the wicked buried, who had come and gone from the place of holiness, and they were forgotten"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Some Heb. mss., LXX, Vg. praised"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the city where they had so done. This also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " vanity. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Because the sentence against an evil work is not executed speedily, therefore the heart of the sons of men is fully set in them to do evil. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Though a sinner does evil a hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "times,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "days"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " are prolonged, yet I surely know that it will be well with those who fear God, who fear before Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But it will not be well with the wicked; nor will he prolong "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " days, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as a shadow, because he does not fear before God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There is a vanity which occurs on earth, that there are just "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to whom it happens according to the work of the wicked; again, there are wicked "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to whom it happens according to the work of the righteous. I said that this also "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " vanity."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So I commended enjoyment, because a man has nothing better under the sun than to eat, drink, and be merry; for this will remain with him in his labor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the days of his life which God gives him under the sun."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When I applied my heart to know wisdom and to see the business that is done on earth, even though one sees no sleep day or night, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "then I saw all the work of God, that a man cannot find out the work that is done under the sun. For though a man labors to discover "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " yet he will not find "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " moreover, though a wise "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " attempts to know "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he will not be able to find "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}